  messages:
  - some object you can drag and drop like this slees box or that chair
  - take slees from box with pressing right mouse button
  - look at this shotgun, take it
  - for use it open muzzle by press [R]
  - when muzzle is open, press right mouse button for put in, and left mouse to take
    out
  - after that press [R] to close and shoot
  - after shooting open muzzle and take off slees to put in next
